versation.svg) FAQ's](#faq_Property)\n\n* Apartment Sizes Ranges in Between 368 sqft - 583 sqft.\n* Total Units & Towers: 467 Units & Towers\n* Total Project Area: 2 Acres\n* Possession: June, 2025\n* Rera: P51800019891\n\n## About\n\nChandak Nishchay Wing B is a remarkable Residential project located in the well-connected Borivali East locality of Mumbai. Spanning 2 Acres, the project features 467 Units in Details Available Upon Request, offering a mix of 1 BHK+1T, to 2 BHK+2T Apartments ranging from 368 sqft to 583 sqft. The address for the project is s.v. road, 10 min drive from, borivali east, mumbai, maharashtra..\n\n**Available Property Sizes**\n\nThe Apartments at Chandak Nishchay Wing B are available in a variety of sizes. The 1 BHK+1T units start at 368 sqft. The larger 2 BHK+2T Apartments go up to 583 sqft, providing ample space for families of all sizes.\n\n**Price Range**\n\nThe prices for the Apartments at Chandak Nishchay Wing B are designed to be accessible, with 1 BHK+1T units priced from 1.07 Cr and 2 BHK+2T Apartments from 1.7 Cr, depending on the size and configuration.\n\n**Developer Information**\n\nThe project is being developed by Chandak Group, known for its commitment to quality and timely delivery. RERA registration number for the project is P51800019891 Units. Possession is expected to begin in 2025-06-10, ensuring that the property is well on track for future homeowners.\n\n**Amenities and Features**\n\nChandak Nishchay Wing B is designed to offer a blend of luxury and convenience. Key sports amenities include a Kids Play Area, Swimming Pool, Gym. For relaxation, the development offers a Lifts, Car Parking, Power Back-up, Water Storage, Club house, Garden. The security features include CCTV for enhanced safety.\n\n**Construction and Specifications**\n\nThe project is constructed using premium materials such as vitrified tiles for flooring, granite countertops in the kitchens, and high-end sanitary ware in the bathrooms. These materials ensure both durability and elegance in every home.\n\n**Key Information**\n\n* Total Area: 2 Acres\n* Units & Towers: 467 Units, Details Available Upon Request\n* Sizes: 368 sqft to 583 sqft\n* Project Address: s.v. road, 10 min drive from, borivali east, mumbai, maharashtra.\n* Type: Residential Apartments\n* Developer: Chandak Group\n* RERA Registration No.: P51800019891 Units\n* Possession Start: 2025-06-10\n* Construction Quality: Premium materials, vitrified tiles, granite countertops\n* Security: CCTV\n* Sports Facilities: Kids Play Area, Swimming Pool, Gym\n* Convenience Amenities: Lifts, Car Parking, Power Back-up, Water Storage, Club house, Garden\n\n**Location Benefits**\n\nChandak Nishchay Wing B benefits from its location in Borivali East, offering great connectivity to schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and public transport systems. This makes it an ideal place to live, especially for families.\n\n**Developer and Project Details**\n\nPossession at Chandak Nishchay Wing B will begin in 2025-06-10, and the project is RERA registered under P51800019891 Units. Developed by Chandak Group, this project promises a reliable investment for prospective homeowners.\n\n### Sports Amenities\n\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804595_kids-play-area.svg) Kids Play Area\n* ![Swimming Pool](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804565_swimming-pool.svg) Swimming Pool\n* ![Gym](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804743_gym.svg) Gym\n\n### Convenience Amenities\n\n* ![Lifts](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804644_lift.svg) Lifts\n* ![Car Parking](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804679_parking.svg) Car Parking\n* ![Power Back-up](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886956_power_back_up.svg) Power Back-up\n* ![Water Storage](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886749_water_storage.svg) Water Storage\n* ![Club house](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804551_club-house.svg) Club house\n* ![garden](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804627_garden.svg) Garden\n\n### Safety Amenities\n\n* ![CCTV](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528887020_cctv.svg) CCTV\n\n## Floor Plans of Chandak Nishchay Wing B\n\n![Chandak Nishchay Wing B Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/floorplan/64606/1638292163_2bhk.jpg \"Chandak Nishchay Wing B Floor Plan 368 sqft\")\n\n1 BHK (368 Sq. Ft.)\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n## EMI Calculator\n\nLoan Amount (80% of Total Cost) : 85.96 Lakhs\n\n## Rental Options Available!\n\nExplore rental flats in Godrej E-City\n\n [Check Rental Listings →](https://rental.addressofchoice.com/property-for-rent-in-chandak-nishchay-wing-b-borivali-east-mumbai-prop64606)\n\n## Bank Offers for Chandak Nishchay Wing B\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958784_sbi.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958779_icici.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958773_hdfc.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958767_axis.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958761_canara.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958377_indiabulls.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958423_pnb.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958411_tata.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528957944_reliance_capital.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528956975_dhfl.png \" \")\n\n![imageBackh](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/imageBackh.png)\n\n## Hi! I'm here to answer all your queries.\n\n**Vaishali Vasant Tiwari**  \n Relationship Manager\n\n[Chat with us](https://wa.me/8800117588?text=I'm%20intere