 to the Chandak Nishchay. It is the only nearest bus stop & is located at a distance of 0.4 Kms.\n\n### How many units are in Chandak Nishchay?\n\nChandak Nishchay has a total of 167 units. These units are located in 3 towers, with each tower offering a mix of 1 BHK Flats.\n\n### What is the RERA number of Chandak Nishchay?\n\nThe RERA number of Chandak Nishchay is P51800009954 , P51800015985. You can easily find it on RERA official website.\n\n### Which is nearest metro station to Chandak Nishchay?\n\nThe nearest metro station to Chandak Nishchay is Magathane Metro Station. It is 0.7 Kms away from Chandak Nishchay.\n\n### What is the area pin code of Chandak Nishchay?\n\nThe pin code for Chandak Nishchay in Borivali East, Mumbai is 400066.\n\n### How many flats are available for sale in Chandak Nishchay on Magicbricks?\n\nThere are a total of 18 flats available for sale on Magicbricks.\n\nShow more\n\ni\n\nThis project was last updated on 08 September 2026 i View Details\n\nLast Updated Details\n\n*   4 Sale Property 'Posted on Sep 6, 2026'\n*   1 Rent Property 'Posted on Sep 3, 2026'\n\nProperties for Sale\n\n*   [1 BHK Flats for Sale in Chandak Nishchay](https://www.magicbricks.com/project-chandak-nishchay-1bhk-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n*   [2 BHK Flats for Sale in Chandak Nishchay](https://www.magicbricks.com/project-chandak-nishchay-2bhk-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n*   [3 BHK Flats for Sale in Chandak Nishchay](https://www.magicbricks.com/project-chandak-nishchay-3bhk-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n*   [4 BHK Flats for Sale in Chandak Nishchay](https://www.magicbricks.com/project-chandak-nishchay-4bhk-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n*   [Flats for Sale in Chandak Nishchay](https://www.magicbricks.com/project-chandak-nishchay-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n\nView More\n\nProperties for Rent\n\n*   [1 BHK Flats for Rent in Chandak Nishchay](https://www.magicbricks.com/project-chandak-nishchay-1bhk-for-rent-in-mumbai-pppfr)\n*   [2 BHK Flats for Rent in Chandak Nishchay](https